{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "交", "id": "交"}, {"form": "侯", "id": "侯"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "肉", "id": "肉"}, {"form": "託", "id": "託"}, {"form": "諸", "id": "諸"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "際", "id": "際"}, {"form": "餽", "id": "餽"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.513656063073986, "source": "禮", "target": "餽"}, {"weight": 2.2905125117597764, "source": "禮", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.513656063073986, "source": "禮", "target": "際"}, {"weight": 2.028148247292285, "source": "禮", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 1.33500106673234, "source": "禮", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.5973653311998313, "source": "禮", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 3.4944853160857123, "source": "禮", "target": "託"}, {"weight": 2.1952023319554517, "source": "禮", "target": "諸"}, {"weight": 0.6041135581895478, "source": "禮", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 2.2905125117597764, "source": "禮", "target": "門"}, {"weight": 2.9444389791664403, "source": "託", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 1.8080863625154837, "source": "託", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 3.1114930638296068, "source": "託", "target": "諸"}, {"weight": 1.8458266904983307, "source": "託", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.1081909549658215, "source": "託", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.2512917986064953, "source": "國", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.33500106673234, "source": "國", "target": "門"}, {"weight": 0.3794896217049037, "source": "國", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 0.6418538861723947, "source": "國", "t